; M221 — tool change area soft limits: X MIN_LIMIT = [TOOLCHANGER]X_MIN_LIMIT.
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M221 modalgroup=10 ngc=m221
; Sets motion.digital-out-08 (mux2 tc-x-min-limit -> ini.*.min_limit,
; postgui.hal). Also called by toolchange.ngc; M220 or any abort restores the
; work area. The dwell + M66 queue buster let task apply the limit before more
; moves are queued.

o<m221> sub
  M64 P8
  G4 P0.2
  M66 P2 L0
o<m221> endsub
M2
